{"seq":52,"slug":"multi-agent-systems","title":"多智能体系统与协作","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems","rating":{"composite":3.92,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 多智能体系统与协作\n\n一个智能体能调用工具、能规划、能记忆，已经足够强大——那为什么还要让多个智能体协作？答案藏在「分工」与「视角」两个词里：当任务跨越多个专业领域、需要并行推进、或要求互相审查纠错时，把一个无所不包的巨型提示拆成若干各司其职的智能体，往往比堆叠单体能力更可靠。这个 hub 讲的就是「多个智能体如何协调成一个系统」，而不是「单个智能体如何变强」——后者属于智能体开发、框架与记忆等姊妹 hub 的范畴。\n\n整个 hub 沿四条主线层层递进。\n\n第一条是**基础**：先厘清多智能体范式的动机与代价，再深入智能体之间「说话的方式」（通信与协议）与「组织的方式」（协调模型）。没有共同的消息语义与协调结构，再聪明的个体也只是一盘散沙。\n\n第二条是**协作机制**：在能通信、能协调的前提下，智能体如何分工专业化、如何在意见不一致时协商达成共识、又如何被一个编排层统一调度。这一章把抽象的协调原则落到可实现的工程模式上。\n\n第三条是**涌现与博弈**：当多个有自身目标的智能体同处一个环境，合作与竞争如何此消彼长？简单的局部规则又怎样涌现出全局的复杂行为？以及，如何用强化学习让一群智能体自己学会协调——这是从「人手工编排」走向「自主习得」的关键一跃。\n\n第四条是**系统与应用**：把前三章的原理落到 2026 年真实可用的大模型多智能体框架上，讲清楚如何评估与调试这类天然难以观测的系统，最后用真实落地案例收束全书。\n\n读完会发现，多智能体的难点从来不在单个智能体多强，而在「协调的代价能否被它带来的收益抵消」。这条主线贯穿四章，也是判断一个多智能体方案是否成立的根本标尺。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mas-paradigm","title":"多智能体范式与动机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/foundations/mas-paradigm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"agent-communication","title":"智能体通信与协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/foundations/agent-communication"},{"seq":3,"slug":"coordination-models","title":"协调模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/foundations/coordination-models"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"collaboration","title":"协作机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/collaboration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"role-specialization","title":"角色分工与专业化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/collaboration/role-specialization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"negotiation-consensus","title":"协商与共识","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/collaboration/negotiation-consensus"},{"seq":3,"slug":"orchestration-patterns","title":"编排模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/collaboration/orchestration-patterns"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"emergence","title":"涌现与博弈","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/emergence","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cooperation-competition","title":"合作与竞争","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/emergence/cooperation-competition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"emergent-behavior","title":"涌现行为","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/emergence/emergent-behavior"},{"seq":3,"slug":"marl","title":"多智能体强化学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/emergence/marl"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"systems","title":"系统与应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"llm-multi-agent","title":"大模型多智能体框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/systems/llm-multi-agent"},{"seq":2,"slug":"evaluation-debugging","title":"评估与调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/systems/evaluation-debugging"},{"seq":3,"slug":"real-world-applications","title":"真实应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/systems/real-world-applications"}]}]}